## NIF (`tax_number`)

### Implementation

- `validate_tax_number(value)` in [`proformas/services.py`](proformas/services.py)
- Reference: [`ClientForm.clean_tax_number`](proformas/forms.py)

### Validation (when provided)

1. Strip non-digits
2. Fewer than 9 → “NIF has fewer than 9 digits.”
3. More than 9 → “NIF has more than 9 digits.”
4. Exactly 9 → first-digit set + checksum in `validate_tax_number`
5. Empty / whitespace → only when optional for that entity; save as `""`

### Uniqueness

- Constraint condition excludes blank: `~Q(tax_number="")`
- Duplicate check in `clean_tax_number` only when normalized value is non-empty

### Checklist — new/changed NIF field

- [ ] `docs/data-points.md` states required vs optional
- [ ] `clean_*` calls `validate_tax_number` (or skips when blank and optional)
- [ ] `configure_nine_digit_form_field` on the form field
- [ ] Uniqueness excludes `tax_number=""` when applicable

